{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdJ5jnJw6yNTRZQvDDCM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've added all six events from `docs/EVENTS.md` to the registration and offers screens, all sent through `Analytics.capture`. `dart format` and `flutter analyze` pass with no issues. There are no tests and I didn't run the app, so the events haven't been seen arriving in PostHog.\n\nThe changes are in `lib/screens/registration_screen.dart` and `lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`. Since you're on the PostHog free tier, I set them up to send as few events as the funnel needs:\n- **Slider and scrolling:** both report on every frame, so `loan_amount_changed` fires once when the user lets go of the slider, and `offers_scrolled` fires when a scroll comes to rest.\n- **Once per visit:** `registration_email_started`, `registration_phone_started` and `offers_scrolled` each fire only once per screen visit.\n- **`terms_accepted`:** fires only when the box is ticked, not when it's unticked.\n- **No personal data:** the email and phone number are never sent.\n\nSome things that might matter to product:\n- **`offers_scrolled` offset:** it's where the first scroll stopped, not how far the user got in total. Recording the furthest point would mean sending the event when the screen closes, which is lost if the app is killed.\n- **`terms` on Continue:** it will always be `true`, because the button only becomes active after terms are accepted.\n- **`OfferScreen`:** I changed it to a stateful widget so it can remember that the event was already sent.\n\n`flutter pub get` and `flutter analyze` generated some files and rewrote `analysis_options.yaml`. I removed the files and restored `analysis_options.yaml`, so only the two screens and `ANSWER.md` have changed. I didn't touch `android/key.properties`, which was already there.\n\nSeparately, `README.md` has what looks like a real partner-bank sandbox API key in plain text, committed to git. I left it alone, but you may want to replace it with a placeholder and issue a new key.\n\nEverything is written up in `ANSWER.md`. Nothing was committed or sent to any outside service."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1348,"cache_read_input_tokens":30724,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1348},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0dc33723-b729-4fc6-a722-1108a89d090e","uuid":"5252fd12-ed51-4d59-b9af-b68a3e577a2a","timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:15:25.937Z","request_id":"req_011CgdJ5jKHVKaMojtUDzYgv"}
